## ---------------------------------------------------------------
##  Main settings

# default: ignore all files
*

# Allow Directories
!*/


## ---------------------------------------------------------------
##  Project specific

## deckrd
# settings
!.gitignore
!**/*.json

# skills
!**/*.sh
!**/*.md
# dictionaries bundled with skills
!**/*.dic


## ---------------------------------------------------------------
##  Re-apply root exclusions (the allow rules above would reopen them)

# session files
**/*session.json
**/*session

# .env files
**/.env*
!**/.env.example

# dependencies
**/node_modules/
